{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14668","roadmapSlug":"data-analyst","nodeId":"BJTVa4ur_bJB7mMtD2-hQ","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.099Z","description":"# Central Tendency\n\nMeasures of central tendency describe the center or typical value of a dataset. The three main measures are mean (arithmetic average), median (middle value), and mode (most frequent value). The choice between them depends on the data's distribution and whether outliers are present.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Measures of central tendency","url":"https://www.abs.gov.au/statistics/understanding-statistics/statistical-terms-and-concepts/measures-central-tendency","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a1c"},{"type":"video","title":"Understanding Central Tendency","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n_sSVhHBdj4","_id":"6a7f4a4fcb44947debcf5a1d"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:11.488Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a8894ecaca636c6b9e973f1","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Analyst in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/1GK1qD"},{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d041675b","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/AgYmJK"},{"_id":"6a5e189a077863512aba4c73","title":"roadmap.sh - Master SQL","partner":"roadmap.sh","type":"course","url":"https://roadmap.sh/courses/sql"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-analyst/content/BJTVa4ur_bJB7mMtD2-hQ.md"}